#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/migrations/data_changes.rst:3
msgid "Data changes"
msgstr "Dataændringer"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/migrations/data_changes.rst:5
msgid ""
"Data changes are done in Migrations by creating an array that will be parsed"
" by ``\\phpbb\\db\\migrator::run_step()``"
msgstr ""
"Dataændringer udføres i migreringer ved at oprette et array, der bliver "
"analyseret af ``\\phpbb\\db\\migrator::run_step()``"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/migrations/data_changes.rst:9
msgid "Basics"
msgstr "Grundlæggende"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/migrations/data_changes.rst:11
msgid ""
"When performing data changes, your Migrations class should contain at least "
"one function, update_data(). You may optionally provide a function "
"revert_data(), which will be run when the migration is removed."
msgstr ""
"Når du foretager dataændringer, bør din migreringsklasse indeholde mindst én"
" funktion, update_data(). Du kan valgfrit angive en funktion revert_data(), "
"som køres, når migreringen fjernes."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/migrations/data_changes.rst:16
msgid "update_data"
msgstr "update_data"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/migrations/data_changes.rst:18
msgid ""
"``update_data()`` will be called as the **second** step, after "
"``update_schema()`` when installing a migration. This makes any database "
"data changes you need when installing the migration."
msgstr ""
"``update_data()`` kaldes som **andet** trin, efter ``update_schema()``, når "
"en migrering installeres. Dette foretager de databasedataændringer, du har "
"brug for, når migreringen installeres."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/migrations/data_changes.rst:30
msgid "revert_data"
msgstr "revert_data"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/migrations/data_changes.rst:32
msgid ""
"``revert_data()`` will be called when a Migration must be uninstalled (this "
"could happen if the user wants/needs to revert changes by the Migration, a "
"dependency is reverted, or the installation fails and the entire Migration "
"is removed)."
msgstr ""
"``revert_data()`` kaldes, når en migrering skal afinstalleres (dette kan "
"ske, hvis brugeren ønsker/skal fortryde ændringer foretaget af migreringen, "
"en afhængighed fortrydes, eller installationen mislykkes, og hele "
"migreringen fjernes)."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/migrations/data_changes.rst:37
msgid ""
"This function is entirely optional, **most data is automatically reverted.**"
" All calls to the Migration Tools are automatically reverted. The only thing"
" this should do is handle reverting any custom functions that were run if it"
" is absolutely needed."
msgstr ""
"Denne funktion er helt valgfri, **de fleste data fortrydes automatisk.** "
"Alle kald til migreringsværktøjerne fortrydes automatisk. Det eneste, denne "
"funktion bør gøre, er at håndtere fortrydelse af eventuelle brugerdefinerede"
" funktioner, der blev kørt, hvis det er absolut nødvendigt."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/migrations/data_changes.rst:51
msgid "What to return"
msgstr "Hvad der skal returneres"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/migrations/data_changes.rst:53
msgid "An array of arrays containing instructions."
msgstr "Et array af arrays, der indeholder instruktioner."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/migrations/data_changes.rst:55
msgid ""
"These instructions can include calls to Tools. For any config settings, "
"permission related commands, and modules, please see the related "
"documentation under :doc:`tools/index`."
msgstr ""
"Disse instruktioner kan omfatte kald til værktøjer. For "
"konfigurationsindstillinger, tilladelsesrelaterede kommandoer og moduler, se"
" den relaterede dokumentation under :doc:`tools/index`."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/migrations/data_changes.rst:61
msgid "If (Conditional)"
msgstr "If (betinget)"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/migrations/data_changes.rst:63
msgid ""
"If call allows you to create a basic if statement which will be checked and,"
" if true, the attached statement will be parsed."
msgstr ""
"If-kaldet giver dig mulighed for at oprette en grundlæggende if-sætning, som"
" kontrolleres, og hvis den er sand, analyseres den tilknyttede sætning."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/migrations/data_changes.rst:67
#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/migrations/data_changes.rst:109
msgid "How it works"
msgstr "Sådan fungerer det"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/migrations/data_changes.rst:77
#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/migrations/data_changes.rst:183
msgid "Examples"
msgstr "Eksempler"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/migrations/data_changes.rst:79
msgid ""
"if config \"captcha_gd\" is true, update \"captcha_plugin\" with "
"\"phpbb_captcha_gd\""
msgstr ""
"hvis config \"captcha_gd\" er true, opdater \"captcha_plugin\" med "
"\"phpbb_captcha_gd\""

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/migrations/data_changes.rst:88
msgid ""
"if config \"allow_avatar_upload\" or \"allow_avatar_local\" is true, update "
"\"allow_avatar\" with value \"1\""
msgstr ""
"hvis config \"allow_avatar_upload\" eller \"allow_avatar_local\" er true, "
"opdater \"allow_avatar\" med værdien \"1\""

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/migrations/data_changes.rst:101
msgid ""
"Calls to the Migration Tools wrapped in the if conditional will **not** be "
"automatically reverted, as if statements are ignored by the "
"``revert_data()`` method. You must define your own ``revert_data()`` method "
"to revert any of these data changes if necessary."
msgstr ""
"Kald til migreringsværktøjerne, der er pakket ind i den betingede if-"
"sætning, vil **ikke** blive fortrudt automatisk, da if-sætninger ignoreres "
"af metoden ``revert_data()``. Du skal definere din egen "
"``revert_data()``-metode for at fortryde disse dataændringer, hvis det er "
"nødvendigt."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/migrations/data_changes.rst:104
msgid "Custom"
msgstr "Brugerdefineret"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/migrations/data_changes.rst:106
msgid ""
"Custom calls allow you to specify the callable to your own function to be "
"called."
msgstr ""
"Brugerdefinerede kald giver dig mulighed for at angive den callable til din "
"egen funktion, der skal kaldes."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/migrations/data_changes.rst:118
#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/migrations/data_changes.rst:145
msgid "Example"
msgstr "Eksempel"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/migrations/data_changes.rst:120
msgid "Call a function within the migrations file named some_function"
msgstr "Kalder en funktion i migreringsfilen ved navn some_function"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/migrations/data_changes.rst:130
msgid "The function called, must be public accessible"
msgstr "Den kaldte funktion skal være offentligt tilgængelig"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/migrations/data_changes.rst:133
msgid "Multi step processes"
msgstr "Processer med flere trin"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/migrations/data_changes.rst:135
msgid ""
"If you have a function that needs to be called multiple times to complete, "
"returning anything except null or true will cause the function to be called "
"until null or true is returned."
msgstr ""
"Hvis du har en funktion, der skal kaldes flere gange for at fuldføres, vil "
"returnering af noget andet end null eller true medføre, at funktionen kaldes"
" igen, indtil null eller true returneres."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/migrations/data_changes.rst:141
msgid ""
"This should be used when something needs to be run that can take longer than"
" the time limit (for example, resyncing topics)."
msgstr ""
"Dette bør bruges, når noget skal køres, som kan tage længere tid end "
"tidsgrænsen (f.eks. resynkronisering af emner)."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/migrations/data_changes.rst:185
msgid "From ``\\phpbb\\db\\migration\\data\\v310\\dev``"
msgstr "Fra ``\\phpbb\\db\\migration\\data\\v310\\dev``"
